  "_comment": "Units of medicines. `strength`: a unit of the amount of a substance in a dose form (read from the registry by `match`, a Ukrainian regular expression). `dose`: a unit the user takes a medicine in (courses, roadmap stage 9). `names`: short forms the application shows.",
